<title>FRANCE: Alcatel holds Havas stake for the moment.</title>
<headline>Alcatel holds Havas stake for the moment.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom chairman Serge Tchuruk said that while the company was free to sell its remaining 7.1 percent stake in media group Havas, it intended to hold on for a while.</p>
<p>&quot;In the long term I do not have any ambition of being a main shareholder in Havas. But Havas has now a clear strategy and it is maybe a good investment for the medium term. We will see what happens,&quot; Tchuruk told a news conference.</p>
<p>Alcatel made 3.4 billion francs in early 1997 on the sale of eight million Havas shares to Generale des Eaux.</p>
</text>
